correction-training-2d demo — NOTICE

This directory (apps/correction-training-2d/) is a CPU-only pedagogical 2D
re-implementation of the core idea of "Correction Training for Diffusion Models".
It does NOT vendor the upstream ImageNet codebase; only the training loss
(Algorithm 1) and the K-correction sampler (Algorithm 2) are re-implemented on a
2D mixture of Gaussians with tiny MLPs. The demo code here and upstream are both
MIT-licensed (see LICENSE).

Upstream (attribution):
