           Copyright (c) 2026 Donghoon Ahn and contributors) — NOT vendored here
  Paper:   Ahn, Wang, Efros, Park, Belhe,
           "Correction Training for Diffusion Models", 2026, arXiv:2610.14136
  Project: https://sunovivid.github.io/correction-training/
           (also https://correction-training.github.io/)
  Found via a bookmarked X post by @donghoon_ahn:
           https://x.com/donghoon_ahn/status/2110038016622493951

The official ImageNet sampling path (SiT-REPA / DiT / JiT checkpoints, ~11 GB)
requires an NVIDIA GPU and is intentionally NOT run or downloaded here. A
prepared, unexecuted Colab notebook (notebooks/correction_training_imagenet_colab.ipynb)
documents how to run it; GPU spend needs owner approval.

No warranty. Research / demo use. Model weights trained here stay out of git
(work/ is git-ignored).
